        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Shit, bro, take my name if you want, but you didn't have to steal my entire past!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "posfrom": "100,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.8,
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "How dare you slander me! I wrote the entire application myself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1",
        "posfrom": "-30,0",
        "posto": "20,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.8,
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you recite it from memory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "H-How am I supposed to pull something I wrote a year ago from memory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Oakley, born in Bunkerhill, graduate of Trimounts College of Arts and Science, previously worked as a guide in the Human Development and Technological Inovation Department of the District Convention Center...'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "'Innovation' is misspelled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You! Damn you, if I didn't lose my terminal and CV\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
