    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Gordon's head has never hurt so badly.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The holes in the onboarding process are obvious upon further inspection. But the real question is\u2014",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Why would she impersonate a guide?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Is she a Leithanian spy? A DOD agent? Or a pair of eyes that D.C. is keeping on him?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The impostor has already made contact with many corporations at the preview exhibition. Dealing with her now means broadcasting his negligence to the whole country.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Besides, Gordon has no idea how much she knows, and whether she has ill intentions towards him and Columbia...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Gordon does not dare to think about it any further."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
