    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your gaze wanders when you speak. Your voice is trembling, and you talk without rhyme or reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I doubt Mr. Tannen would want such an 'Oakley' to handle promotion work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't bring Mr. Tannen into this! I tell you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley!"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
