    {
        "text": "Mr. Tannen, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up. I just pulled your activity records from the park here. It won't be hard to figure out just who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "One more lie, and I'm throwing you off this plate. It won't matter who you are when you're a puddle on the ground six hundred meters down. You get me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now talk. Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A guide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got balls, I'll give you that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-The kind of guide the tourists need!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "My name is Ferne. I-I'm a tour guide.",
