    {
        "text": "My apologies, Mr. Oakley. Mr. Tannen will make sure that this matter is dealt with promptly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you believe me now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oakley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2037_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. You can reach me through this terminal if you need anything. Now, get some rest. I'll be going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
