    },
    {
        "text": "You said Oakley got himself drunk a month ago after a breakup, and he gave you his resume instead of his contact info, which gave you a chance to sneak into Propeller Paradise under his identity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your client was an old Banshee who somehow got lost in the Bleached Wasteland. Her memory was hazy and it was difficult to communicate with her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You suspected that she was ill, and you were asking around under the guise of a guide to make her journey a smooth one, which is why you looked like you were up to something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've spent a whole month here. You know this is no ordinary place. If you're a foreign spy, the military take you in for questioning, torture, and you'll never again see the light of day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're an agent from the Department of Defense, D.C. won't let you off the hook. They'll disavow, distort, and even dispose of you, all for the sake of tipping the scales to their side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're a District plant, then you've learned too much, and ATAO taught me plenty of ways to help you 'forget'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're just a tour guide who cares for her client. You're a good person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Columbia will do good by a good person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You aren't going to press charges?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Believe me, I'd love to, but too many corporations have noticed your performance at the pre-expo. You'll deal with your problems and get lost before they find out who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The longer you stay, the more I have to compensate the poor guy whose name you stole. If all you want to do is to clear the mind of your Banshee client, I can help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know about Banshees?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know how to solve your problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
