        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2051_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 0,
        "action": "zoom",
        "poszoom": "0.5,0.5",
        "scale": 0.95,
        "duration": 0,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "isblock": true,
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You shouldn't touch an overloaded converter with your bare hands, Director!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Works better than an incantation. How are the readings?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "By exhibition standards, the technology for high-altitude energy transmission through plants is sufficiently mature. By the standards of your expectations for the project, however...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not good enough. The energy transmission threshold for the floating botanical unit falls short of theoretical values.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That prickly Forte kid would chill out a bit if you said as much to him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sky is inexperienced, but he was right about one thing\u2014this Vivarium is Kristen's legacy, and we owe it to her to do our best.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were always stubborn, going back to when we dug out the S.H.A.F.T. together five years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You pulled all-nighters to ensure its structural integrity, enchanting the core materials with incantations. Nothing could get you to take a break, not even your favorite gummy worms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to go fincatching, do it at Lake Sulligan. Assuming I approve your leave request, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, I worked so many hours just because I was inefficient. I learned to write curses too late. My incantations suffer in strength and precision compared to my kindred, because they rely on sound as the sole medium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that why you modified your bone pen and use hole-punched paper tapes to supplement your casting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I took a lot of wrong turns.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nasti takes out her bone pen, a plain, unornamented object resembling Rhine's technological creations."
    },
    {
        "text": "She inserts it into a sapling in the Vivarium, and a white glow rises from the roots, through the branches and into every leaf."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is as though a command has been entered into the whole Vivarium; terminals begin to execute programs, automatically recording plant energy conversion data."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_activation"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.3
    },
