    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "focus": "r",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Such an efficient programming language, your incantations...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, we should make more efficient decisions at this bottleneck, despite the risks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Review the report again. Thank you for your work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, ma'am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Veteran Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
