        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, this is the Rhine Vivarium Lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, Director Lunorey. Mr. Tannen has asked me to express his gratitude at your reasonable accommodation that led to successful cooperation the last time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some follow-up matters to be discussed. Do you have time this afternoon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent. I will see you in the Vivarium in an hour.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mercia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nasti"
    },
