        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$relax_intro",
        "key": "$relax_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$6",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Intruder alert, intruder alert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unknown Entity"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$3",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Activating bio-scan. Analyzing results. Species: Terran. Sex: Male. Threat level: Pending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unknown Entity"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#4$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "A-A talking finbeast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$2",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Mind your words, foolish Terran! I am Space Fin 054. State your Universe ID number, immediately!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#5$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Universe ID...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$6",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Your corporate name, nitwit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#3$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, uh, Lucky Cystybeast Food and Beverage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$3",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, so you are the partner that 'Sky Conqueror' was expecting. How unfortunate that I won't get the chance to test my laser cannons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$6",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Don't touch anything. The supervisor will be here momentarily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#5$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Supervisor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$6",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Five-Four, make sure you speak like an extraterrestrial entity next time you do the client explanation thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2040_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aye aye, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Space Finbeast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#5$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Mr. Tannen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh\u2014don't huff and puff. The polite thing to do when you stand in this collection of unique curiosities, the likes of which you will not find anywhere else in Terra, is to admire it with your eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the wall on your right. Five years ago, I confiscated the possessions of a pioneer trying to illegally cross the border, and found an unusual water circulation and filtration system in his trailer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "text": "He helped me find the core component in exchange for looking the other way. When the unit was assembled, I identified it as a Locus of Sorcery\u2014a Sarkaz witchcraft weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#4$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "My goodness, it must be dangerous...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Turn around and look behind you. This is a trident Arts unit from Leithanien, created by Witch King cultists who wanted to amplify Arts output so they could rip apart the fabric of reality and summon their master.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kinda crazy, sure, but its conversion efficiency is fifty times the max allowed by Propeller Paradise regulations. Even an onion could fly with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#5$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, so you solved One-Boot's technical issues with... contraband?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Contraband? ATAO made up the stupid rule about only using parts made in Columbia!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know and I don't care about the reasons behind the decisions. All I know is that these rules are un-Columbian. They restrict scientists, and force entrepreneurs to lie!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a single humble ATAO officer who imported inventions from across Terra into Propeller Paradise, forming the heart and soul of one-third of all levitating facilities here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#1$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "One-third... you've run hundreds of smuggling operations without getting exposed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every transaction, every deal has gone without a hitch under my management. Not even my secretary Merry knows my secrets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2041_1#1$1",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I need time to think about this, Mr. Tannen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucky Cystybeast has one day left, and I got other things on my plate. I'll give you five seconds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2034_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucky Cystybeast gets a mongrel heart, or you let it die to your stubborn pride. Choose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gordon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
